# Hardcoded mise shim - deterministic on every machine (a template-time
# PATH lookup would depend on the applying machine's PATH). homeDir is
# expanded by the template at apply time: chezmoi fork/execs this string
# directly and never expands `~` itself. Bootstrap caveat: before the first
# `mise install`, `chezmoi diff` aborts with a fork/exec error (apply
# unaffected) - re-run after install. Full detail lives in AGENTS.md
# ("Check for drift").
diff:
  command: {{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/share/mise/shims/delta
